            "title": "Question: Counter variable",
            "id": 86462,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu koddaki sayaç değişkeninin adı nedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"year = \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" year &lt;= \" /><text value=\"2025\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;It's \" /><text value=\"{year}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  year += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"It's 2020\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2021\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2022\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2023\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2024\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2025\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>year</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kodda sayaç değişkeni yok</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>year</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 86470,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu <code>while</code> döngüsünün koşulu nedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"year = \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" year &lt;= \" /><text value=\"2025\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;It's \" /><text value=\"{year}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  year += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"It's 2020\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2021\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2022\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2023\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2024\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2025\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>year += 1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>year &lt;= 2025</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>year = 2020</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>while</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>year &lt;= 2025</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing the counter",
            "id": 86467,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  i += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code>'den <code>9</code>'a kadar olan sayılar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code> ile <code>10</code> arasındaki sayılar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code> ile <code>9</code> arasındaki sayılar</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code>'dan <code>11</code>'e kadar olan sayılar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>1</code> ile <code>10</code> arasındaki sayılar.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Code in the code block",
            "id": 86471,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code> ile <code>5</code> arasındaki sayılar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code>'den <code>4</code>'e kadar olan sayılar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code>'ten <code>5</code>'e kadar olan sayılar</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code>'den <code>4</code>'e kadar olan sayılar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>2</code> ile <code>5</code> arasındaki sayılar.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Changing the condition",
            "id": 86469,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"trial = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" trial &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  trial += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(trial)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>4</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
