          {
            "title": "Example: Counter variable",
            "id": 86500,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>counter</code> adlı bir sayaç değişkeni oluştur ve ona <code>-1</code> ata.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &gt;= \" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter -= \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"12\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"-1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>counter = -1</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Condition",
            "id": 86466,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>number</code>'ın <code>10</code>'dan küçük olup olmadığını kontrol edecek şekilde koşulu değiştir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number = \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(number)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  number += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt; 10</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Changing the counter variable",
            "id": 86464,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>i</code> değişkenine bir değer atayarak <code>while</code> döngüsündeki kod bloğunu 4 kez tekrarla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  i += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"1\" /><option startIndex=\"2\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>i</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>0</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Incrementing the counter",
            "id": 86461,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kod bloğunda <code>evens</code> değişkenini <code>2</code> artırarak sonsuz döngüyü önle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"evens = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" evens &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  evens += \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(evens)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>evens</code>, ardından <code>+=</code> ve son olarak <code>2</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
