            "id": 86468,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code>'den <code>4</code>'e kadar olan sayılar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code>'den <code>5</code>'e kadar olan sayılar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code> ile <code>5</code> arasındaki sayılar</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code>'den <code>4</code>'e kadar olan sayılar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>1</code>'den <code>4</code>'e kadar olan sayılar.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Code in the code block",
            "id": 86463,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>1</code> ile <code>7</code> arasındaki sayıları konsolda görüntüle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"days = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" days &lt; \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  days += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(days)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"days += 2\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print(&quot;days&quot;)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>days += 1</code>, ardından <code>print(days)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
